# Links to attachments: a missing one is reported and nothing is created; a canvas opens the
# whiteboard; a dotted note name is still a note. drive.rs adds Inbox/Field trip.md first.
size 120x24
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace
keys p
type field trip
wait-for 1 notes
keys enter
wait-for Inbox/Field trip  reading
wait-for reading · j
keys tab
keys K
wait-for PDF document
wait-for trail map.pdf isn't in the workspace
screen
keys esc
wait-gone PDF document
keys enter
wait-for trail map.pdf isn't in the workspace
expect Inbox/Field trip  reading
keys tab enter
wait-for tickets/ticket.pdf isn't in the workspace
expect Inbox/Field trip  reading
keys tab enter
wait-for whiteboard Welcome
keys ctrl+o
wait-for Inbox/Field trip  reading
keys tab enter
wait-for Volcanoes/Mount St. Helens  reading
keys esc
wait-gone reading · Esc / q back
keys q
exits 0
